Self-contained; no upstream tool dependencies. All params are USER-supplied: time_min, time_max (YYYY-MM-DD), value_to_plot (enum: total_visits/session_duration_seconds/user_engaged/visits_direct/visits_referral/visits_search_engine/visits_social_media), and plot_type (enum: bar/line/scatter/histogram). Do not invent values outside the allowed enums.
